\ DPART-OV.CMP 11-13-85                                         \ Leaving planet orbit cleanup.                                 \ --------------- OVERLAY PREFIX FOR DPART-OV -------------                                                                     VOCABULARY DPART-VOC IMMEDIATE                                  66 OPEN-OVERLAY                                                 DPART-VOC DEFINITIONS                                           1000 TRANS-ALLOT NEWT-DP                                                                                                        \ ---------------------------------------------------------     \ End of game reward.                                           \ ---------------------------------------------------------     \                                                               1000 C: HIBEEP                                                  4000 C: LOBEEP                                                  48 11 255 IFIELD: PHRASE$                                                                                                       HEAD: MESSPREFIX ( -- )                                         \ Get user's attention.                                         T: >MAINVIEW >2FONT                                                3 0 DO HIBEEP TONE BEEPON                                              DK-BLUE !COLOR BFILL                                            V>DISPLAY 200 MS                                                LT-BLUE !COLOR BFILL                                            BLACK !COLOR                                                    12 100 POS. " INCOMING" TYPE                                    24  80 POS. " HIGH"     TYPE                                    15  60 POS. " PRIORITY" TYPE                                    17  40 POS. " MESSAGE"  TYPE                                    LOBEEP TONE                                                     V>DISPLAY 500 MS                                              LOOP BEEPOFF T;                                                                                                         HEAD: MEDAL>MAINVIEW ( -- )                                     \ Show Interstel Medal of Sublime Achievement in                \ mainview screen.                                              T: 4 191 POS. PAD ADDR>SEG 1+ DUP 60 FILE< ' .HYBRID MODULE T;  \ ** include medal picture in a disk communication picture      \    compile.                                                                                                                   HEAD: STARTMUSIC ( -- )                                         \ Start theme song playing.                                     \ ** see bob, rod.                                              T: " START THEME MUSIC" .TTY T;                                                                                                 HEAD: ENDMUSIC ( -- )                                           \ Halt playing of theme song.                                                                                                   T: " END THEME MUSIC" .TTY T;                                                                                                   HEAD: .PHRASE ( { i -- i } )                                    \ Display the current phrase instance in the text window.       T: PHRASE$ COUNT HUFF>   \ decompress phrase                       LSCAN COUNT ' P>CT MODULE T;                                                                                                 HEAD: .PHRASES ( { i -- i } )                                   \ Display current phrase and any child phrases.                 T: CDEPTH                                                          BEGIN .PHRASE                                                     ?CHILD                                                        WHILE                                                             IOPEN                                                         REPEAT                                                          CDEPTH SWAP - ?DUP                                              IF 0 DO ICLOSE LOOP THEN T;                                                                                                  HEAD: .AWARDMESSAGE ( -- )                                      \ Display award message through text window -- slowly           \ scrolling.                                                    T: WHITE !COLOR                                                    (AWARD) @>C+S .PHRASES ICLOSE T;                                                                                             : REWARD ( -- )                                                 \ Present award to player for winning the game.                 \ Assumes Crystal planet has just been destroyed by the         \ Black Egg. This overlay called from Black Egg overlay.          TIME-PASSING OFF                                                MESSPREFIX                                                      MEDAL>MAINVIEW                                                  STARTMUSIC                                                      .AWARDMESSAGE                                                   ENDMUSIC \ insert 500,000 mu bonus transaction                  TIME-PASSING ON ;                                                                                                             \ ---------------------------------------------------------                                                                     : ?REMOVE ( -- t , { an object -- same } )                      \ Test if ok to delete the object. True = ok to delete.         \ 68=creature, 41=ruins, 26=elements,                           \ 28=artifacts (non-special)                                    \ Deletes virtual ruins.                                          @INST-CLASS >R                                                  I 68 =                                                          I 41 = DUP IF @INST-SPECIES 3 < AND THEN                        I 26 =                                                          I 28 = DUP IF @INST-SPECIES 16 51 WITHIN AND THEN               OR OR OR I DROP ;                                                                                                             : ?DELETE ( t -- )                                              \ Delete object if true on stack.                                 IF IDELETE IPREV THEN INEXT ;                                                                                                 : CRIT-DELETE ( -- )                                            \ Remove critters when leaving planet.                            (PLANET) @>C+S IOPEN                                            BEGIN                                                             11 11 IFIND  \ for each region box.                           WHILE                                                             IOPEN                                                           BEGIN                                                             ?LAST NOT ?NULL NOT AND                                       WHILE                                                             ?REMOVE ?DELETE                                               REPEAT                                                          ?REMOVE IF IDELETE THEN                                         ?NULL ICLOSE ?DELETE      \ delete region if empty            REPEAT                                                          CDROP ICLOSE ;                                                                                                                : OTHER-DELETE ( -- )                                           \ Such as regions, super-box. Leaves behind: messages,          \ artifacts specimens. Leaves boxes if they contain any         \ of these types.                                                (PLANET) @>C+S IOPEN CDROP  \ ?first bug                        SUPER-BOX @>C+S                                                 IDELETE IFIRST    \ call after tv>ship cargo transfer!!         BEGIN                                                             67 0 IFIND                                                     WHILE                                                            IDELETE         \ remove regions                              REPEAT                                                          CDROP ICLOSE ;                                                 : 1SEC 1000 MS ;                                                : .BOMBMESS ( -- )                                              \ Message to user about bomb.                                     WHITE !COLOR                                                    " CAPTAIN, WE ARE RECEIVING A " .TTY                            " COUNTDOWN TRANSMISSION FROM " .TTY                            " THE BLACK EGG... " .TTY 1SEC                                  " 5 " .TTY 1SEC " 4 " .TTY 1SEC " 3 " .TTY 1SEC                 " 2 " .TTY 1SEC " 1 " .TTY ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  : FLASHCOLOR                                                    \ Fill mainview and aux with color c.                             !COLOR >MAINVIEW BFILL V>DISPLAY V>AUX ;                                                                                      : EXPLOSION ( -- )                                              \ Do planet explosion special effects.                            " BOOM!" .TTY \ insert exploding noise                          3 0 DO BLACK ORANGE RED ORANGE YELLOW                                  ORANGE YELLOW WHITE YELLOW WHITE                                10 0 DO FLASHCOLOR LOOP LOOP ;                                                                                         : ?CRYSTAL ( -- t )                                             \ Is the current planet the dreaded crystal planet?               (PLANET) @>C+S                                                  @INST-SPECIES ICLOSE  23 = ;                                                                                                  : ?ATNEXUS ( -- t )                                             \ Is the current bomb at the control nexus?                     \ Control nexus is 47 N 45 E (730,1440 abs).                      (BOMB) @>C+S ?-NULL                                             IF INST-X @  730 - ABS                                             INST-Y @ 1440 - ABS + 10 <                                   ELSE 0                                                          THEN ICLOSE ;                                                 23 17 1 IFIELD: ORBIT-MASK                                                                                                      : CLRORBMASK ( -- )                                             \ Clear the bit in the orbit mask of the system to              \ kill planet.                                                    (ORBIT) @>C+S INST-QTY @ ICLOSE ( -- orb# )                     BIT                             ( -- mask )                     (SYSTEM) @>C+S ORBIT-MASK C@ XOR                                ORBIT-MASK C! ICLOSE ;                                                                                                        : ?DELETEPLANET ( -- t )                                        \ Delete planet unless it is the crystal planet and the         \ black egg is not close to the control nexus.                    ?CRYSTAL IF ?ATNEXUS ELSE 1 THEN                                IF CLRORBMASK                                                      (SYSTEM) @>C+S                                                  (ORBIT) @>C+S -ICON  \ remove from display list                 IDELETE              \ remove from object list                  CDROP ICLOSE                                                 THEN ;                                                                                                                        : DEPART ( -- )                                                 \ If black egg bomb left on planet and armed, then explode      \ the planet. If the planet is the Crystal Planet then only     \ explode the planet if the black egg is placed close to        \ the control nexus else only do special effects and say        \ that the planet is not destroyed. If black egg not left       \ and armed, then discard transient objects on planet.          ?LANDED @                                                       IF ?BOMB @                                                        IF ?DELETEPLANET        ( -- t )                                   .BOMBMESS                                                       EXPLOSION                                                       IF   " PLANET OBLITERATED." .TTY                                     ?CRYSTAL                                                        IF REWARD THEN   \ winning game reward.                    ELSE " CRYSTAL PLANET DAMAGED " .TTY                                 " BUT NOT DESTROYED." .TTY                                 THEN                                                                                                                            NULL (BOMB) 1.5! ?BOMB OFF                                   ELSE                                                               CRIT-DELETE OTHER-DELETE                                     THEN                                                          THEN PLHI OFF ?LANDED OFF ; \ force bio scanning of next planet \ --------------- OVERLAY SUFFIX FOR DPART-OV -------------                                                                     DISPOSE                                                         CLOSE-OVERLAY                                                   66 OVERLAY DPART-OV                                             DPART-OV                                                        FORTH DEFINITIONS                                               : DEPART DPART-OV DPART-VOC DEPART ;                                                                                            OV-CANCEL                                                       \ ---------------------------------------------------------                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     